# Anger on the battlefield has haste itself but gives nothing to Bot1's other creatures, though Bot1 controls
# Mountains: the grant functions only while the card is in the graveyard. Once it is bolted on turn 8, Bot1's
# creatures have haste - the Welder already there, and the Embereth Shieldbreaker cast on turn 9, which attacks at once.
# Bot2's own Welder never gets it: Bot2 controls Mountains too, but "creatures you control" are Anger's owner's.

